unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:2em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">近日，国务院印发《关于推进服务业扩能提质的意见》。《意见》明确，<span style=\"color:#0d5db7;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">到2030年，服务业总规模迈上100万亿元台阶</strong></span>，培育更多&ldquo;中国服务&rdquo;品牌。《意见》提出四个方面20条具体举措，其中</span><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"color:#0d5db7;box-sizing:border-box;\">多项任务与建筑行业深度关联</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">，为工程勘察设计、建筑数字化、绿色低碳、城市更新、基础设施建设等领域带来新机遇、注入新动能。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align:justify;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"text-align:center;margin:20px 0px;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section data-width=\"95%\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block;line-height:0;width:95%;height:auto;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100% !important;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"text-align:left;justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-flow:row;margin:20px 0px -20px;box-sizing:border-box;transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);-ms-transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform:translate3d(20px, 0px, 0px);\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;min-width:10%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;align-self:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100% !important;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align:justify;justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-flow:row;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;min-width:10%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;background-color:rgb(13, 93, 183);align-self:flex-start;